DESCRIPTION:ObesityWeek 2026 is the annual conference of The Obesity Soci
 ety\, held at the Gaylord National Resort and Convention Center in Natio
 nal Harbor\, Maryland\, near Washington\, D.C. The program presents clin
 ical and basic science research on obesity and its treatment.\n\nDeadlin
 es\nAbstract submission opens: 2026-03-16\nAbstract submission: 2026-04-
 27\nLate-breaking abstract submission opens: 2026-06-29\nLate-breaking a
 bstract submission: 2026-07-22\nEarly registration: 2026-08-24\n\nhttps:
 //obesityweek.org/
LOCATION:National Harbor\, Maryland\, Gaylord National Resort and Convent
 ion Center
URL:https://obesityweek.org/
